---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Section from '../components/Section.astro';
import PageHero from '../components/PageHero.astro';
import { SITE } from '../lib/site';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy policy"
  description="How FIKRA collects, uses and protects your personal information."
>
  <Section>
    <PageHero eyebrow="Legal" title="Privacy policy" />
  </Section>

  <Section tone="white">
    <div class="prose">
      <p>
        This policy explains what personal information FIKRA collects through
        this website, why we collect it, and how we look after it. It is a
        starting draft for review — FIKRA should align it with its constitution
        and any applicable data-protection law before launch.
      </p>

      <h2>What we collect</h2>
      <p>
        When you use a form on this site, we collect the information you provide:
        your name, email address, phone number, organisation and message, and
        the programme or interest you selected.
      </p>
      <p>
        This site does not use advertising cookies. Any analytics we use are
        cookie-free and do not identify you personally.
      </p>

      <h2>Why we use it</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>To respond to your enquiry or application</li>
        <li>To contact you about programmes, volunteering or partnerships you asked about</li>
        <li>To keep appropriate records of our work and reporting</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Who can see it</h2>
      <p>
        Your information is available only to the FIKRA staff and volunteers who
        need it to respond to you. We do not sell your information. It is shared
        with service providers only where necessary to operate the site (for
        example, our email service), and only to the extent needed.
      </p>

      <h2>How long we keep it</h2>
      <p>
        We keep enquiry and application details only as long as needed for the
        purpose you provided them, or as required by law.
      </p>

      <h2>Your choices</h2>
      <p>
        You can ask us to show you the information we hold about you, correct
        it, or delete it. To do so, email
        <a href={`mailto:${SITE.email}`}>{SITE.email}</a>.
      </p>

      <h2>Contact</h2>
      <p>
        Questions about this policy can be sent to
        <a href={`mailto:${SITE.email}`}>{SITE.email}</a>.
      </p>
    </div>
  </Section>
</BaseLayout>
